            "field": "Dependency",
            "fieldtype": "custom",
            "from_string": "SFCC-748 (Disclaimer Contentful Content Type) — Contentful content type must exist before content-driven ACs can be tested end-to-end.\nSFCC-55 / PWA Kit Footer story — Disclaimer renders above the Footer; confirm rendering order and shared layout context with the dev team.\n\nOpen Items:\n@Zimmermann / Business: Confirm on which pages the Disclaimer component appears — is it global (all pages above the footer) or only on specific pages (e.g. PDP, Checkout)?\n@Zimmermann / Business: Confirm which storefront page the READ MORE link navigates to (e.g. Terms and Conditions page, Privacy Policy page) — and whether this destination varies per storefront. (AC8)\n@Design team: Confirm whether the title is always TERMS AND CONDITIONS or varies by page/storefront — if fixed, it may not need to be fetched from Contentful.",
            "to_string": "[SFCC-748] (Disclaimer Contentful Content Type) — Contentful content type must exist before content-driven ACs can be tested end-to-end.\n\nOpen Items:\n@Zimmermann / Business: Confirm on which pages the Disclaimer component appears — is it global (all pages above the footer) or only on specific pages (e.g. PDP, Checkout)?\n@Zimmermann / Business: Confirm which storefront page the READ MORE link navigates to (e.g. Terms and Conditions page, Privacy Policy page) — and whether this destination varies per storefront. (AC8)\n@Design team: Confirm whether the title is always TERMS AND CONDITIONS or varies by page/storefront — if fixed, it may not need to be fetched from Contentful.",
            "from_id": "",
            "to_id": ""
          }
        ],
