renders in any state, then it displays correctly across desktop, tablet, and mobile breakpoints in line with Figma specifications.\n\nAccessibility\n\nGiven the Remove and Wishlist links render on a cart item, when navigated via keyboard or read by a screen reader, then both links are focusable, activatable via the Enter key, and announced with descriptive labels.\n\nGiven an error or warning message renders beneath the stepper, when read by a screen reader, then the message is announced via an ARIA live region so the Shopper is informed without having to navigate to it.",
