            "field": "description",
            "fieldtype": "jira",
            "from_string": "*As a* Shopper, *I want* to see a consistent and complete cart item tile in my bag, *so that* I can review my selections before proceeding to checkout.\n\nThis is a *PWA Kit component story focused on UI only*. It covers the build of the Cart Item React component — the individual product tile that renders for each line item in the cart. This story is UI-only. *No PO approval required — designs have been signed off.*\n\nThe Cart Item component renders the following elements per line item: product image, product name, price, colour, size, quantity stepper (+ and - controls), Remove link, and Wishlist link. All data is served from SFCC via PWA Kit. Hover/focus/active visual states are defined in the UI kit and are not repeated here.\n\n_Design UI Kit:_ [https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann_Design_System_2026?node-id=40002540-26065&p=f&t=TmtWOmzv22deb8Pq-0|https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann_Design_System_2026?node-id=40002540-26065&p=f&t=TmtWOmzv22deb8Pq-0|smart-link] \n\n!image-20260824-225451.png|width=1142,alt=\"image-20260824-225451.png\"!",
            "to_string": "*As a* Shopper, *I want* to see a consistent and complete cart item tile in my bag, *so that* I can review my selections before proceeding to checkout.\n\nThis is a *PWA Kit component story focused on UI only*. It covers the build of the Cart Item React component — the individual product tile that renders for each line item in the cart. This story is UI-only. *No PO approval required — designs have been signed off.*\n\nThe Cart Item component renders the following elements per line item: product image, product name, price, colour, size, quantity stepper (+ and - controls), Remove link, and Wishlist link. All data is served from SFCC via PWA Kit. Hover/focus/active visual states are defined in the UI kit and are not repeated here.\n\n_Design UI Kit:_ [https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann_Design_System_2026?node-id=40002540-26065&p=f&t=TmtWOmzv22deb8Pq-0|https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann_Design_System_2026?node-id=40002540-26065&p=f&t=TmtWOmzv22deb8Pq-0|smart-link] \n\n!image-20260826-002407.png|width=1126,alt=\"image-20260826-002407.png\"!"
          }
        ],
