        "items": [
          {
            "field": "description",
            "fieldtype": "jira",
            "from_string": "As a Developer, I want to build the cart drawer as a reusable PWA Kit component, so that it can be triggered from any surface on the site and render the correct state based on the current basket contents.\n\nThis is a PWA Kit component story — it covers the cart drawer container, header states, open/close behaviour, and responsive layout. It does not cover accessibility since this is just a variation of the drawer component.\n\nIt does not cover the components that render within the drawer — each has its own dedicated story. The drawer is the container component for all other cart stories and is a dependency for;\n\n* [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-270|https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-270|smart-link] \n* [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-274|https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-274|smart-link] \n* [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-316|https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-316|smart-link] \n* [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-318|https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-318|smart-link] \n* [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-404|https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-404|smart-link] \n\nThe open and close animation for the cart drawer is defined in [https://zimmermann-handover-ja2o39l78-song-ddp-anz.vercel.app/#templates%2Fmain|https://zimmermann-handover-ja2o39l78-song-ddp-anz.vercel.app/#templates%2Fmain]\n\n_Full Cart:_\n\n!image-20260825-015154.png|width=747,alt=\"image-20260825-015154.png\"!\n\n_Empty Cart:_\n\n!image-20260825-015227.png|width=999,alt=\"image-20260825-015227.png\"!\n\n_Cart Designs:_ [https://www.figma.com/design/QQ427wHWEUjsjP7H8v48Rs/Zimmermann_Designs?node-id=3193-45519&p=f&t=KplXOHcaZuhgS2Qs-0|https://www.figma.com/design/QQ427wHWEUjsjP7H8v48Rs/Zimmermann_Designs?node-id=3193-45519&p=f&t=KplXOHcaZuhgS2Qs-0|smart-link] \n\n_UI Design Kit:_ [https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann_Design_System_2026?node-id=40000938-5082&p=f&t=X5fHFHkybHS9wAkf-0|https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann_Design_System_2026?node-id=40000938-5082&p=f&t=X5fHFHkybHS9wAkf-0|smart-link] ",
            "to_string": "As a Developer, I want to build the cart drawer as a reusable PWA Kit component, so that it can be triggered from any surface on the site and render the correct state based on the current basket contents.\n\nThis is a PWA Kit component story — it covers the cart drawer container, header states, open/close behaviour, and responsive layout. It does not cover accessibility since this is just a variation of the drawer component.\n\nIt does not cover the components that render within the drawer — each has its own dedicated story. The drawer is the container component for all other cart stories and is a dependency for;\n\n* [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-270|https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-270|smart-link] \n* [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-274|https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-274|smart-link] \n* [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-316|https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-316|smart-link] \n* [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-318|https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-318|smart-link] \n* [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-404|https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-404|smart-link] \n\nThe open and close animation for the cart drawer is defined in [https://zimmermann-handover-ja2o39l78-song-ddp-anz.vercel.app/#templates%2Fmain|https://zimmermann-handover-ja2o39l78-song-ddp-anz.vercel.app/#templates%2Fmain]\n\n_Full Cart:_\n\n!image-20260908-034058.png|width=725,alt=\"image-20260908-034058.png\"!\n\n\n\n_Empty Cart:_ \n\n!image-20260908-034026.png|width=710,alt=\"image-20260908-034026.png\"!"
