            "from_string": "As a Shopper, I want the cart to open as a slide-in panel with a clear header and close control, so that I can view and manage my bag without leaving the page I am on.\n\nThe cart renders as a slide-in drawer/overlay panel. It has two header states depending on cart content — when the cart contains items the header displays \"BAG • [item count]\" with a dynamic item count and an X close icon; when the cart is empty the header displays \"YOUR BAG IS EMPTY\" with an X close icon. This component is the container for all other cart stories and is a dependency for SFCC-270 through SFCC-301.\n\nAll cart state and item count data is served from SFCC via the PWA Kit. The panel itself is a PWA Kit component — no Contentful involvement in the drawer/header behaviour.",
            "to_string": "As a Shopper, I want the cart to open as a slide-in panel with a clear header and close control, so that I can view and manage my bag without leaving the page I am on.\n\nThe cart renders as a slide-in drawer/overlay panel. It has two header states depending on cart content — when the cart contains items the header displays \"BAG • [item count]\" with a dynamic item count and an X close icon; when the cart is empty the header displays \"YOUR BAG IS EMPTY\" with an X close icon. This component is the container for all other cart stories and is a dependency for SFCC-270 through SFCC-301.\n\nAll cart state and item count data is served from SFCC via the PWA Kit. The panel itself is a PWA Kit component — no Contentful involvement in the drawer/header behaviour.\n\n*Image for reference (Figma is leading):*\n\nFull Cart\n\n!image-20260803-235728.png|width=1149,alt=\"image-20260803-235728.png\"!\n\nEmpty Cart\n\n!image-20260803-235740.png|width=1149,alt=\"image-20260803-235740.png\"!"
          }
        ],
