      {
        "items": [
          {
            "field": "description",
            "fieldtype": "jira",
            "from_string": "As a Shopper, I want to remove an item from my cart or move it to my wishlist directly from the cart page, so that I can manage my bag without losing products I may want to purchase later.\n\nThis story describes the behaviour of the “Remove” and “Wishlist” CTAs in the Cart Item Component - [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-270|https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-270|smart-link] \n\nThe Wishlist CTA triggers two other components\n\n* Cart Success Banner - [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-404|https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-404|smart-link] \n* Error Success Banner - [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-404|https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-404|smart-link] \n\n_Cart Designs:_  [https://www.figma.com/design/QQ427wHWEUjsjP7H8v48Rs/Zimmermann_Designs?node-id=6057-6527&t=JaAD9J3Z1NoRjGvs-0|https://www.figma.com/design/QQ427wHWEUjsjP7H8v48Rs/Zimmermann_Designs?node-id=6057-6527&t=JaAD9J3Z1NoRjGvs-0|smart-link] \n\n*Image for reference (figma leading):*\n\n!image-20260825-011059.png|width=803,alt=\"image-20260825-011059.png\"!\n\n_Success Messaging:_ \n\n!image-20260825-012213.png|width=1142,alt=\"image-20260825-012213.png\"!\n\n_Error Messaging:_\n\n!image-20260825-012236.png|width=1142,alt=\"image-20260825-012236.png\"!",
            "to_string": "As a Shopper, I want to remove an item from my cart or move it to my wishlist directly from the cart page, so that I can manage my bag without losing products I may want to purchase later.\n\nThis story is dependent on other components being developed, including: \n\n*  [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-270|https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-270|smart-link] \n* [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-404|https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-404|smart-link] \n* [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-404|https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-404|smart-link] \n* [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-274|https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-274|smart-link] \n* [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-315|https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-315|smart-link] \n\n_Cart Designs:_  [https://www.figma.com/design/QQ427wHWEUjsjP7H8v48Rs/Zimmermann_Designs?node-id=6057-6527&t=JaAD9J3Z1NoRjGvs-0|https://www.figma.com/design/QQ427wHWEUjsjP7H8v48Rs/Zimmermann_Designs?node-id=6057-6527&t=JaAD9J3Z1NoRjGvs-0|smart-link] \n\n*Image for reference (figma leading):*\n\n!image-20260825-011059.png|width=803,alt=\"image-20260825-011059.png\"!\n\n_Success Messaging:_ \n\n!image-20260825-012213.png|width=1142,alt=\"image-20260825-012213.png\"!\n\n_Error Messaging:_\n\n!image-20260825-012236.png|width=1142,alt=\"image-20260825-012236.png\"!"
          }
