            "from_string": "1. Given a Shopper views a line item in the cart, when they click \"Remove\", then the item is immediately removed from the cart and the order summary updates.\n2. Given the cart had only one item and the Shopper removes it, when the removal completes, then the empty cart state is displayed as per SFCC-277.\n3. Given an Authenticated Shopper clicks \"Wishlist\" on a line item, when the action completes, then the item is moved to their wishlist and removed from the cart.\n4. Given a Guest Shopper clicks \"Wishlist\" on a line item, when the action is taken, then they are redirected to the login/registration page and the item remains in the cart until they authenticate.\n5. Given a Guest Shopper authenticates after being redirected, when they return to the cart, then a success message is displayed confirming the item has been added to their wishlist.",
            "to_string": "1. Given a Shopper views a line item in the cart, when they click \"Remove\", then the item is immediately removed from the cart and the order summary updates.\n2. Given the cart had only one item and the Shopper removes it, when the removal completes, then the empty cart state is displayed as per SFCC-277.\n3. Given an Authenticated Shopper clicks \"Wishlist\" on a line item, when the action completes, then the item is moved to their wishlist, removed from the cart, and a success message is displayed confirming the item has been added to their wishlist.\n4. Given a Guest Shopper clicks \"Wishlist\" on a line item, when the action is taken, then they are redirected to the login/registration page and the item remains in the cart until they authenticate.\n5. Given a Guest Shopper authenticates after being redirected, when they return to the cart, then a success message is displayed confirming the item has been added to their wishlist.",
            "from_id": "",
            "to_id": ""
          }
