      {
        "items": [
          {
            "field": "description",
            "fieldtype": "jira",
            "from_string": "*As a* Shopper, I want to be clearly informed when I have reached the maximum purchase quantity for a product in my bag, so that I understand why I cannot add more and can still proceed to checkout.\n\nThis story covers the *behaviour and interaction between multiple cart components* when the maximum purchase quantity is reached — it is not a component build story. The following components must be developed before this story can be implemented end to end:\n\n* *Cart Item component* — renders the quantity stepper and inline warning message \n* *Page-level banner* — renders the banner at the top of the cart drawer\n\n_Cart Designs:_ [https://www.figma.com/design/QQ427wHWEUjsjP7H8v48Rs/Zimmermann_Designs?node-id=7383-167327&t=DHEB8HQOXjUUIvMn-0|https://www.figma.com/design/QQ427wHWEUjsjP7H8v48Rs/Zimmermann_Designs?node-id=7383-167327&t=DHEB8HQOXjUUIvMn-0|smart-link] \n\n!image-20260825-052315.png|width=1142,alt=\"image-20260825-052315.png\"!",
            "to_string": "*As a* Shopper, I want to be clearly informed when I have reached the maximum purchase quantity for a product in my bag, so that I understand why I cannot add more and can still proceed to checkout.\n\nThis story covers the *behaviour and interaction between multiple cart components* when the maximum purchase quantity is reached — it is not a component build story. The following components must be developed before this story can be implemented end to end:\n\n* *Cart Item component* — renders the quantity stepper and inline warning message \n* *Page-level banner* — renders the banner at the top of the cart drawer\n\n!image-20260908-032015.png|width=875,alt=\"image-20260908-032015.png\"!"
          }
        ],
