            "from_string": "As a Shopper, I want to be clearly informed when I've reached the maximum purchase quantity for a product in my bag, so that I understand why I can't increase the quantity further.\n\nThe maximum purchase quantity is configured globally in Business Manager and enforced at the variant level (per size/colour). The applicable limit is resolved in order of specificity: SKU → Customer Group → Global default (see SFCC-268 and SFCC-703). When a shopper attempts to increase the quantity of a line item beyond the applicable limit, the increment control is disabled and an inline message is displayed. The checkout CTA remains available unless another condition blocks it — the max quantity limit alone does not block checkout on a quantity that was already valid.",
