            "from_string": "@Payments epic: G Pay and Apple Pay integration behaviour (payment sheet, tokenisation, order placement) must be fully defined and implemented in the Payments epic before ACs 6 and 7 can be tested end-to-end.\n@Accenture Dev / Payments epic: Google Pay Express must be configured and available before the G Pay button can be fully tested on the cart page — confirm this is covered in the Payments epic and flag when available.",
            "to_string": "@Payments epic (SFCC-13): Google Pay Express and Apple Pay Express button rendering, display logic, browser/device detection, payment flows, tokenisation, and order placement are all owned by the Payments epic — not this story. A placeholder story has been created in SFCC-13 to cover this.\n@Jasmijn Tsang / @Zimmermann: Open item — the decision on whether a real-time inventory check fires between cart and checkout entry is still pending. Once confirmed, the behaviour of the Checkout CTA when a stock check fails will need to be added to this story or covered in the inventory check story.",
