                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given the component is rendered, when it opens, then it slides in from the right on desktop and full-width on mobile leaving a small space open at the bottom, with a dark overlay backdrop."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "406f5c15eccb"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "5cf63c1709f9"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given the drawer is open, when the shopper scrolls the country list, then the drawer header and the Confirm footer remain sticky and the country list scrolls independently."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "30e9b4a88649"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "f9368ca432fd"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given the shopper selects a country and presses the Apply CTA, when confirmed, then onConfirm(country, locale) fires with the selected values and the consuming page handles the redirect."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "2e6600e6e095"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "84af071a39a4"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given the drawer is open, when the shopper presses the close (x) icon or the backdrop, then the drawer closes without firing the callback and the prior selection is retained."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "08ec5f73457d"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "accessibility",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "strong"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "attrs": {
                "localId": "0e4822c6f72c"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "orderedList",
              "attrs": {
                "order": 1,
                "localId": "1b8889675024"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "a94870569ff8"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given the component is rendered, when a keyboard user navigates, then focus is trapped within the open drawer, radio buttons are navigable via arrow keys, and closing the drawer returns focus to the trigger element."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "a2edb342a007"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "9d752ef66a2a"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given the component renders on desktop, when viewed on mobile, then the drawer is full-width and all interactive elements meet minimum touch target size per the Design System spec."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "d81c7ca76f77"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "03c67dadc5a3"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given the component is rendered, when a screen reader user interacts with the drawer, then the drawer is announced as a dialog with an accessible name, all interactive elements have descriptive labels, the accordion region groups expose expanded/collapsed state via aria-expanded, and the search field (if rendered) has an accessible label."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "b866bc4d436c"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "19212",
      "key": "SFCC-749",
      "summary": "Breadcrumb and SEO – PWA Kit Component",
      "description": "As a\n Shopper, I want to see a breadcrumb on every page and relevant SEO text on category pages, so that I can understand where I am on the site and access additional content about the category I'm browsing.\nThis story covers the PWA Kit component build for the breadcrumb and SEO text component that renders above the footer. The component consumes the Contentful content type defined in SFCC-748.\nBreadcrumb\n\n\nThe breadcrumb renders on every page and is programmatically generated from the current page context (e.g. HOME / COLLECTIONS / RTW). No Contentful authoring is required. Rules can be applied to control breadcrumb display on certain page types — open item: Dani to share Sparro templates.\nSEO Text — Collapsed State\nOn category and sub-category pages, an optional SEO text block renders next to the breadcrumb showing a title and intro text fetched from Contentful, keyed by category ID. If no Contentful entry exists for that category, the SEO text block does not render.\nSEO Text — Expanded State\nIf an expanded SEO body is configured in Contentful for that category, a READ MORE link renders below the intro text. Clicking READ MORE reveals the full SEO body content inline. Clicking READ LESS collapses the panel back to the default state. This applies to all category and sub-category pages.\nUI Design Kit: \nhttps://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann_Design_System_2026?node-id=2083-54022&p=f&t=8DrHJtkYe3Taw9hz-0\n \nExpanded State: \nhttps://www.figma.com/design/QQ427wHWEUjsjP7H8v48Rs/Zimmermann_Designs?node-id=3216-7913&t=JkL5PJpjbuJ8eDae-0",
      "customfield_10231": {
        "value": {
          "type": "doc",
          "version": 1,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "attrs": {
                "localId": "db49f74f5d04"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "orderedList",
              "attrs": {
                "order": 1,
                "localId": "d3f831d785c0"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "98031093aec8"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given a shopper visits any page on the site, when the page loads, then a breadcrumb is displayed reflecting the current page hierarchy (e.g. HOME / COLLECTIONS / RTW), generated programmatically from the page context and not hardcoded."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "fad4795d6c89"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "9ca33ada6ae3"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given a shopper visits a category or sub-category page that has a published Contentful entry for that category ID, when the page loads, then the title and intro text render below the breadcrumb above the footer."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "699c09c42e5c"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "1e2c9e8d2c0c"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given a category or sub-category page has no published Contentful entry configured for that category ID, when the page loads, then the breadcrumb renders as normal but no SEO text block or empty container renders beneath it."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "6070ea6ae069"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "74b90cd47c49"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given a Contentful entry exists for a category but the expanded SEO body field is empty, when the page loads, then the READ MORE link does not render."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "3b972d24d02c"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "8ff2affe4254"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given the SEO text block is in its collapsed state and a READ MORE link is present, when a shopper clicks READ MORE, then the component expands inline to reveal the full SEO body content and READ MORE is replaced by READ LESS."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "22f813abf2a1"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "d07769f0cf67"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given the SEO text component is in its expanded state, when a shopper clicks READ LESS, then the component collapses back to the default state showing only the title, intro text, and READ MORE link."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "947f1727ce6b"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "6b67d7bfdd52"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given Contentful entries are configured per category ID, when a shopper navigates between different category and sub-category pages, then each page renders its own configured SEO content — or no SEO block if no entry exists for that category."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "1cd1ae876956"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "a5530cf18ac3"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given Contentful entries are configured for different locales, when a shopper views a category page on a given locale, then the SEO text reflects the content configured for that locale."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "ed1d27e395e2"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "447331e923f8"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given a shopper navigates to any page, when the breadcrumb renders, then it is marked up using a "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "<nav>",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": " element with an appropriate aria-label (e.g. \"Breadcrumb\") and structured as an ordered list so screen readers can announce the hierarchy correctly."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "1ea4aabbd03f"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "624cf01db0ef"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given a keyboard-only user is navigating the breadcrumb, when they tab through it, then each breadcrumb link is reachable and activatable via keyboard and focus is visible throughout."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "da4930c506f9"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "a45770ea7b80"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given a keyboard-only user is on a category page with a READ MORE link, when they tab to it and press Enter or Space, then the SEO content expands and focus moves into the expanded content. When they tab to READ LESS and press Enter or Space, then the content collapses and focus returns to the READ MORE link."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "a2d08580f560"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "448d897c5d8b"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given a screen reader user interacts with the READ MORE link, when they activate it, then the expanded/collapsed state is correctly announced and the revealed content is accessible and readable in document order."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "2045357a611d"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "adebd047cfff"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given a user has enabled reduced motion at OS level, when the SEO text expands or collapses, then any animation respects the reduced motion preference."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "5e12fdf72be9"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}

