      "customfield_10231": {
        "value": {
          "type": "doc",
          "version": 1,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "1. Given the component is rendered with a valid display prop, when it mounts, then the correct number of ProductCard instances are rendered matching the display value."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "2. Given showTitleAndLink=true and showLink=true, when the component renders, then the section header displays both the title and the link using the linkLabel value."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "3. Given showTitleAndLink=true and showLink=false, when the component renders, then the title is displayed but no link is shown."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "4. Given showTitleAndLink=false, when the component renders, then neither the title nor the link are displayed."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "5. Given the component is rendered with an empty or missing product array, when it mounts, then it renders no product cards and no error is thrown."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "6. Given the component is rendered at size=Desktop or size=Mobile, when it mounts, then the layout matches the corresponding Figma design spec variant."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "7. Given the section header is visible, when rendered, then the title is a semantically correct heading element and the link is a native anchor element with descriptive text."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Accessibility"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "8. Given the component is interactive, when a keyboard user navigates to the link, then it is reachable and activatable via keyboard alone."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "9. Given the component renders product cards, when a screen reader traverses the group, then each card is distinguishable and the group is appropriately labelled."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "10. Given the component is rendered, when tested against WCAG 2.1 AA criteria, then it passes with no violations."
                }
              ],
              "attrs": {
                "localId": "a30059852f7f"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "attrs": {
                "localId": "f529a56f7277"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "rule",
              "attrs": {
                "localId": "2cfc29e9ebac"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Tablet behaviour – ",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "strong"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "display=4",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "code"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "attrs": {
                "localId": "119a99234594"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "The "
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "size",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "code"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " prop should also account for tablet. When the team configures "
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "display=4",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "code"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": ", tablet will only render 3 product cards — the 4th is hidden. This prevents an orphaned card from sitting awkwardly on its own row, as tablet uses a 3-column grid system."
                }
              ],
              "attrs": {
                "localId": "2be49fb45065"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}

